  "title": "GlobalFoundries launches Quantum Technology Solutions to scale U.S. quantum manufacturing",
  "summary": "MALTA, N.Y., May 21, 2026 — GlobalFoundries (Nasdaq: GFS) (GF) today launched Quantum Technology Solutions, a new quantum business to scale the manufacturing capabilities the quantum industry needs to achieve utility-scale quantum computing. The new business launches with customer engagements, and a pipeline of quantum innovators positioned to scale on its platform.",
